      "title": "Desplats Lab at UC San Diego",
      "headings": [],
      "text": "Translating bench discoveries to clinical innovations to transform patient care. We are looking for Master's students for research projects! Click Here to check our career opportunities. Translating bench discoveries to clinical innovations to transform patient care. Our research is focused on elucidating the role of epigenetic mechanisms in the onset and progression of neurodegenerative diseases, particularly Parkinson’s and Alzheimer’s. We seek to understand how gene expression profiles become altered in the brain and contribute to neurodegeneration. Our translational neuroepigenetics program combines cutting-edge, multi-omic technologies with cellular physiology, molecular neuroscience, and neuropathological assays to address mechanistic questions, identify therapeutic targets, and provide novel diagnostic tools. Research News Publications",
